hifiberry-analoginput (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Restart analoginput on upgrade, and stop it on removal. It runs as
    systemd user service of the HiFiBerry user, which debhelper neither
    restarts nor stops, so an upgrade left the old code running -- and a
    removal left it running at all -- until the next reboot or login. The
    restart is a try-restart: a service that is not running, such as a
    player switched off in the WebUI, stays off.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 14:50:18 +0000

